contributors. Local changes, if any, are listed below.

Local changes:
- Cargo.toml rewritten to use crates.io dependencies instead of workspace paths.
- range_boundary: saturating_add instead of `+ 1` to avoid overflow at u64::MAX.
- WalLogStore::released: a signal that fires once the last clone is dropped and the directory
  lock is released, so a caller can reopen the directory without polling.
